
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome to My Website</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
    body { background-color: #f8fafc; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; }
    header { background: #ffffff; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 1.25rem 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    header .logo { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #0f172a; text-decoration: none; }
    nav a { margin-left: 1.5rem; text-decoration: none; color: #475569; font-weight: 500; }
    .hero { text-align: center; padding: 5rem 1.5rem 3rem; max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .hero p { font-size: 1.15rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; background: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; }
    .btn:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }
    .features { max-width: 900px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
    .card { background: #ffffff; padding: 1.75rem; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .card h3 { color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .download-box { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 3rem auto 5rem; text-align: center; }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <a href="#" class="logo">MyBrand</a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#features">Features</a>
      <a href="#download">Download</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="about">
      <h1>Simple, Clean, and Live on the Web</h1>
      <p>This page is hosted on GitHub Pages and routed through Cloudflare DNS.</p>
      <a href="#download" class="btn">Go to Downloads</a>
    </section>

    <section class="features" id="features">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Fast Delivery</h3>
        <p>Pure HTML and CSS with zero bloat, loading instantly everywhere.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>SSL Protected</h3>
        <p>Secured with free automatic HTTPS from GitHub and Cloudflare.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Custom Domain</h3>
        <p>Running directly under your own personal domain name.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="download-box" id="download">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #0f172a;">Download Files</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: #64748b;">Click the button below to download the attached file directly.</p>
      <!-- Change sample.pdf to the name of whatever file you upload -->
      <a href="sample.pdf" class="btn" download>Download PDF File</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 MyBrand. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
